# Place the following ONNX model files here.
# These files are NOT committed to version control.
#
# 1. det_10g.onnx   (~16 MB)  — SCRFD-10GF face detector (buffalo_l)
# 2. w600k_r50.onnx (~250 MB) — ResNet50 ArcFace recognizer
#
# Download the buffalo_l model pack with:
#
#   pip install insightface
#   python -c "
#   from insightface.app import FaceAnalysis
#   app = FaceAnalysis(name='buffalo_l')
#   app.prepare(ctx_id=-1)
#   "
#   # Models are cached at: ~/.insightface/models/buffalo_l/
#   # Copy det_10g.onnx and w600k_r50.onnx to this directory.
#
# Or download directly from:
#   https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface/releases  (buffalo_l pack zip)
